{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】天氣漸涼，大家或者會吃火鍋、浸熱水浴，甚至用電暖氈，但有沒有想過，這些日常舉動中，隨時也有燒傷或燙傷的風險？</p><p>每年十一月的首周是世界燒傷周，《杏林在線》邀請瑪麗醫院頭頸及整形修復外科副顧問醫生吳俊蔚講解，萬一遇到燒燙傷，傷口應該如何處理及加快復原。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T13:39:52.366108+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:45.325273+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T13:37:36.861621+00:00","content_hash":"38ece0812ac28ae69f4c8d05ceaf1770c14ae883e5fe74cbd60a6513f7a2ae92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}